cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite them as below."
title: "Cart-abandonment leakage audit: code and aggregate results"
abstract: >-
  Code and aggregate results for two studies of data leakage in cart-abandonment
  prediction: a leakage audit of completed-session features on the Retail Rocket
  dataset, and a test of the resulting nine-question checklist on five datasets
  from four shops. One command reruns every result of the second study.
type: software
